format: 2
name: String.equals with a boolean argument in an if (F75, #292)
class: Probe
method: m
arg: 05
expect: REJECT JULC0078
note: ADR-067 review F75: Java returns false (2); EqualsString fails on-chain (#292, ADR-062 T34).
note: ADR-068 M6: on the only frontend, javac, REJECT JULC0078; the JavaParser frontend answered DIVERGE T34 Value/Failure.
---
import java.math.BigInteger;

public class Probe {
    public static BigInteger m(BigInteger a) {
        if ("a".equals(true)) {
            return BigInteger.ONE;
        }
        return BigInteger.TWO;
    }
}
